"""Hand-written country facts for geo_countries.py.

Written from general knowledge and checked against common references (UN World Population Prospects
2024 for population, national records for highest points and independence dates). Anything not well
established is left blank and the generator skips it.

TABLE columns (split with " | "):
  code       ISO alpha-3 code, matching mledoze/countries
  pop        population in millions as of 2024 (blank = skip)
  largest    biggest city ("" = the capital, "-" = skip, "!..." = a full answer)
  gov        P   President is head of state and government
             PP  President is head of state, Prime Minister is head of government
             PX  President is head of state and holds most power, with a Prime Minister too
             CR  Commonwealth realm (British monarch, Governor-General, Prime Minister)
             K:<title>  monarch with that title, plus a Prime Minister
             X:<sentence>  full answer;  "-" or blank = skip
  high       "Name;meters" or "Name" or "!full answer" (blank = skip)
  drive      L or R
  indep      full answer about independence or founding (blank = skip)
  flag       full answer describing the flag (blank or "-" = skip)
  known      full answer for "what is it known for"
  food       full answer about famous food (blank = skip)
"""

